       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed collision issues on the Broken planet and in the Workshop – no more falling into the void!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Players starting the full game after trying the demo will now begin a new save to avoid critical errors.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "A new “Nomad” sticker has been added at the end of a specific quest, making it easier to complete for 100%!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "This patch makes the experience smoother and more player-friendly – jump back in and see what’s new in the world of Pilo!",
